            <div xml:id="m-95bb4c53-3bcd-4728-b04e-c500caa74b50">
              <lg xml:id="m-b9397e4e-8de0-4f72-9306-40cca0aeb2dc">
                <l xml:id="m-a96fef7b-b1c4-48bb-a62e-e61721976851" facs="#m-e8c2ad13-3574-417b-8e82-4d2e75bfd847" label="ambiguous">718</l><l xml:id="m-a8186d05-4475-4872-80ca-93b402a52c6e" facs="#m-cdc1e790-8f57-4fb0-8add-406b47919688" label="ambiguous">Good Friday</l><l xml:id="m-dee527ea-5c83-4d7f-91d1-8ac985dbc639" facs="#m-f7fa2eb5-d44f-4364-abb3-31bb26ed6cb8" label="ambiguous">5 Ant.!</l><l xml:id="m-680c8c30-ec01-4d07-9c53-a9306c45264f" facs="#m-27d59467-5c17-4f42-b225-08a0828d5adc" label="ambiguous">86</l><l xml:id="m-ac965714-7d19-4722-a13f-04dbd7eae1aa" facs="#m-6e58da06-af86-4162-ad0c-935abbf2a50f" label="ambiguous">m</l><l xml:id="m-d0bf82c3-a486-48a5-9053-d00cf417f21c" facs="#m-c4430985-37eb-47b3-81c6-e63030daaa9f" label="lyrics-like">Eménto mé-i, “Dómine Dé-us, dum véne-ris in</l><l xml:id="m-259416a0-77ad-44db-a90d-98558d635fdb" facs="#m-b694fd61-70b5-4f9b-9857-fc8293155d42" label="lyrics-like">régnum tú-um.</l><l xml:id="m-b785d706-3111-4745-8846-b68e8bc8e5c2" facs="#m-420fabfb-9ed2-462e-94bf-709ce8545dcf" label="ambiguous">Psalm 147 (New psalter, p. 554)</l><l xml:id="m-4396f885-65a6-4d4d-a63e-fe42ac25957f" facs="#m-5c9866e2-f038-4183-9675-41b282dfa57f" label="lyrics-like">1. Láuda, Jerúsalem, Dóminum:* láuda Dé-um tú-um, Si¬</l><l xml:id="m-46b3ab51-0e95-4852-880b-ddb21f28520a" facs="#m-297e7d60-e09f-4345-9308-a2c087cd4c2f" label="lyrics-like">2. Quóniam confortávit séras portárum tuárum: “benedixit</l><l xml:id="m-d2ab24d4-b256-4b2b-b833-a479d7679ea2" facs="#m-76fde051-748f-4a96-97c6-7cb9f0c1b161" label="ambiguous">ruis tuis in te.</l><l xml:id="m-eae1315d-9b23-4f37-a773-7d53ee2860b8" facs="#m-153d21c0-b9f9-47b9-9d32-529ae204cc8a" label="lyrics-like">3. Qui pósuit fines túos pácem:t ádipe fruménti sátiat te.</l><l xml:id="m-5cc7bed4-96db-4d0f-87d2-524ab772c1d7" facs="#m-c36b37e6-3004-413b-ab83-d3a2af584e87" label="lyrics-like">4. Qui emittit elóquium súum térrae:*velóciter cúrrit sérmo</l><l xml:id="m-7647db42-bf45-4374-b244-a07040976f21" facs="#m-0c713114-35c5-4c79-98d5-a3e67a607b00" label="lyrics-like">éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-490b1548-16be-4f3f-aabd-cd2e2c34485d" facs="#m-d724442b-ad95-4a04-ac5e-1222d19fc158" label="lyrics-like">5. Qui dat nivem sicut lánam: “nébulam sicut cinerem spárgit.</l><l xml:id="m-c6178912-6648-4699-8e6e-7bfa5d45d115" facs="#m-ac223f3e-e7c8-4d5a-93a5-464b81fd945a" label="lyrics-like">6. Mittit crystállum suam sicut buccéllas:* ante fáciem</l><l xml:id="m-304fa430-1a79-48c6-be59-40918f7919a2" facs="#m-2a433735-91c7-44c9-b591-dd7118da31c4" label="lyrics-like">frigoris éjus quis sustinébit?</l><l xml:id="m-c19bad6a-810b-43cb-830b-85a617630778" facs="#m-d81d7572-f01b-4345-b5bf-e0fae1cf73f7" label="lyrics-like">7. Emittet vérbum súum, et liquefáciet éa:“fábit spiritus</l><l xml:id="m-4b2cab89-52d8-4136-9a5b-4fd624cc40a5" facs="#m-331b2e5e-94e5-4872-8f1d-b09722ca1c4e" label="lyrics-like">éjus, et fiüent áquae.</l><l xml:id="m-e7251c8d-5ed1-4926-8411-4343e3723831" facs="#m-ae3832cb-2ef7-46e4-aea0-01e25e9beb4c" label="lyrics-like">8. Qui annúntiat vérbum súum Jácob:*justítias, et judicia</l><l xml:id="m-f0bea1a0-7a1a-445c-b730-5b0d9e8a44e3" facs="#m-526d229b-468c-43fc-97e6-7ff5e0f79134" label="lyrics-like">súa Iaraël.</l><l xml:id="m-e5363d5c-fdb1-460e-b085-e78887619214" facs="#m-3f52d0fb-b619-4932-a43b-dd5f5a870936" label="lyrics-like">9. Non fécit táliter ómni natióni: “t judicia súa non mani¬</l><l xml:id="m-733f9cb7-929f-4d9c-b882-76b7daa8e4fb" facs="#m-bf7fcbef-3ef9-44be-97e0-02260f1e3233" label="lyrics-like">festávit éis.</l><l xml:id="m-d0049932-52e1-47cd-a0ff-999c24723c85" facs="#m-2cfa8853-5842-45d7-ab49-aa5ad295de04" label="lyrics-like">y. Collocávit me in obscú-ris. W. Sicut mórtu-os saécu-li.</l><l xml:id="m-ccba120a-e460-4d88-a781-4e7974b16098" facs="#m-7e49d507-558f-44a3-9a7d-431e5303b31f" label="text-like">Or:</l><l xml:id="m-708e9375-4b6a-436b-942a-d02dfc433acf" facs="#m-aa508790-7e91-415d-bf03-eaee57681298" label="lyrics-like">v. Collocávit me in obscú-ris. W. Sicut mórtu-os saécu-li.</l><l xml:id="m-da364fd2-c4fe-412d-9b5c-75a7dfc0ca92" facs="#m-2edc3c2f-05a9-4ed6-bb9c-205bb288d8ce" label="text-like">At Bened.</l><l xml:id="m-475ba357-332f-47b1-9d4d-0b9fbc170517" facs="#m-7e3e43cb-bf0e-4f23-ba43-9be83f60fcd1" label="ambiguous">Ant. 18</l><l xml:id="m-c41cc380-bb94-4167-9f26-e403e91f8d79" facs="#m-658cc25f-ade5-4b5b-b9e9-2753c946dcf6" label="lyrics-like">Osu-é-runt" super cáput é-jus</l><l xml:id="m-32b2bf3c-81cc-4c76-be4b-6db7ee74b047" facs="#m-15ca61c3-c9e4-4e89-ab1f-9a67ab9fc224" label="lyrics-like">cáusam ipsí¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7e03ee1-e405-46ab-b40f-a5d0ebe483d1" facs="#m-ddff723a-5477-49d7-8617-8955af90a7ba" label="ambiguous">A</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
